flowchart TB
  OBS[Distributed Tracing Observability]
  OBS --> TRACE[Distributed Tracing]
  TRACE --> TID[traceId]
  TRACE --> SID[spanId]
  TRACE --> PID[parentId]
  TRACE --> PROP[Propagation]
  TRACE --> MT[Micrometer Tracing]
  MT --> OTel[OpenTelemetry Bridge]
  MT --> SC[Span Customizers]

  OBS --> ZIPKIN[Zipkin]
  ZIPKIN --> COLLECT[Span Collection]
  ZIPKIN --> UI[Visualization]
  ZIPKIN --> DEP[Span Dependency Graph]

  OBS --> TEMPO[Grafana Tempo]
  TEMPO --> INGEST[Trace Ingestion]
  TEMPO --> QUERY[TraceQL Querying]

  OBS --> LOG[Distributed Logging]
  LOG --> MDC[MDC Correlation IDs]
  LOG --> JSON[JSON Structured Logging]
  LOG --> LOGSTASH[Logstash Encoder]
  LOG --> ELK[ELK Stack]
  LOG --> LOKI[Grafana Loki]

  OBS --> OTEL[OpenTelemetry SDK]
  OTEL --> AUTO[Automatic Instrumentation]
  OTEL --> MANUAL[Manual Instrumentation]
  OTEL --> EXPORT[Exporters]
